&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We may conduct routine verification checks during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You might be asked additional questions to better understand your experience and background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For video interviews, we ask that candidates be on camera without filters or visual modifications.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These steps are applied consistently for all candidates and are designed to ensure an equitable experience for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY EMPLOYER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
